      "content": "thanks for the tip. quick follow up though—i noticed the deficiency seems to be hitting certain patches of the field harder than others, almost like they're being targeted in specific spots. is there any chance there's a localized issue with microbial activity or something in the soil structure that would cause that kind of unevenness?",
